## Fixed smoothing parameters

If you know the appropriate smoothing parameters (e.g., from a previous full fit), you can fix them
to avoid the pilot fit's automatic selection:

::: {#36bfa5f6 .cell execution_count=13}
``` {.python .cell-code}
sgam_fixed = wk.StreamingGAM("y ~ s(x)", smoothing_params=[1.0])
sgam_fixed.partial_fit({"x": x[:100], "y": y[:100]})
sgam_fixed.solve()
print(f"Fixed SP: {sgam_fixed.smoothing_params}")
```

